# Soroban RPC endpoint for mainnet.
#
# Testnet uses the free public endpoint and needs no configuration. Mainnet has
# no public Soroban RPC, so contract calls on mainnet stay disabled until you
# point this at a provider. Classic operations (balances, payments, trustlines,
# history) work on mainnet without it, since those go through Horizon.
#
# Providers: https://developers.stellar.org/docs/data/apis/rpc/providers
VITE_STELLAR_MAINNET_RPC_URL=
